<main>

<section class="page-head">
  <p class="kicker">About</p>
  <h1>A small team building one thing well.</h1>
  <p class="lead">WebPing is a WhatsApp CRM by Webpeaker, built from Jaipur, Rajasthan. We
  work with small and mid-sized businesses whose customers happen to live on WhatsApp —
  which in India is most of them.</p>
</section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="two-col">
    <div>
      <h2>What we make</h2>
      <p>One product: a shared inbox, a broadcast engine and a deal board on the official
      WhatsApp Business Platform. No separate logger, no surprise hand-off to "sync"
      partners, no dashboard full of metrics designed to impress rather than inform.</p>
      <h2>How we work</h2>
      <p>Documentation with honest screenshots. Updates without churn beyond announced
      windows. Refunds without a fight for a full day. Support that answers in a business
      day in writing — no ticket theatre.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2>What we avoid</h2>
      <ul class="plain">
        <li>Vanity numbers on this site. If a claim can't be verified by you, it doesn't get written by us.</li>
        <li>Complex plans with tier confusion. Two plans: Pro and Enterprise.</li>
        <li>Talking to your customers for you. Every automated draft is reviewed by a human.</li>
        <li>Building "engagement theatre". If a chat doesn't lead somewhere, your work should be to follow up or close it cleanly.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Get in touch</h2>
      <p><a href="/contact">Contact page</a> · <a href="mailto:webping@webpeaker.com">webping@webpeaker.com</a> · <a href="tel:+918696778246">+91 86967 78246</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></section>
</main>
